OL,3,GNEWSAWalking football led to
OL,4,Alife-saving kidney match
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Blake and Paul Nettleton are both
OL,7,Fmembers of Bournemouth Walking Football
OL,8,FClub and share a powerful bond.
OL,10,FIt comes from a tragic loss for Paul's
OL,11,Ffamily in 2025, when his son died.
OL,13,FHe and his wife were left with the
OL,14,Funimaginable decision of whether they
OL,15,Fwanted to donate his organs.
OL,17,FRemembering that Paul's teammate John
OL,18,Fhad suffered with chronic kidney
OL,19,Fdisease, they asked if it would be
OL,20,Fpossible to nominate him.
